# Environment Variables

## Basic Configuration
```env
# Server
HOST=0.0.0.0
PORT=8000
DEBUG=false

# Database
DATABASE_URL=postgresql://user:password@localhost:5432/tenant_portal

# Docker
DOCKER_HOST=unix:///var/run/docker.sock

# DNS Provider (Cloudflare example)
DNS_PROVIDER=cloudflare
DNS_API_TOKEN=your-cloudflare-api-token
DNS_ZONE_ID=your-dns-zone-id
DNS_BASE_DOMAIN=apps.example.com

# Email
SMTP_HOST=smtp.example.com
SMTP_PORT=587
SMTP_USER=noreply@example.com
SMTP_PASSWORD=your-smtp-password
SMTP_FROM=noreply@example.com

# Security
SECRET_KEY=your-secret-key-minimum-32-chars
TOKEN_EXPIRY_HOURS=24
```

## DNS Provider Options

### Cloudflare
```env
DNS_PROVIDER=cloudflare
DNS_API_TOKEN=your-cloudflare-api-token
DNS_ZONE_ID=your-dns-zone-id
DNS_BASE_DOMAIN=apps.example.com
```

### Manual (File-based)
```env
DNS_PROVIDER=manual
DNS_HOSTS_FILE=/etc/hosts
DNS_BASE_DOMAIN=apps.example.com
```

## Email Provider Options

### SMTP
```env
SMTP_HOST=smtp.example.com
SMTP_PORT=587
SMTP_USER=noreply@example.com
SMTP_PASSWORD=your-smtp-password
SMTP_FROM=noreply@example.com
```

### SendGrid
```env
SMTP_HOST=smtp.sendgrid.net
SMTP_PORT=587
SMTP_USER=apikey
SMTP_PASSWORD=your-sendgrid-api-key
SMTP_FROM=noreply@example.com
```

## Logging
```env
LOG_LEVEL=INFO
LOG_FORMAT=json
```
